Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.32,0:01:15.34,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{uchuu senkan yamato} Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.30,0:02:06.46,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Warp complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.73,0:02:09.43,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Error correction, 20, 15, 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.43,0:02:10.98,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Correction data sent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.50,0:02:14.03,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire the transit wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.23,0:02:16.01,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Target scope, open.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.37,0:02:21.18,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Targeting the core of the comet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.18,0:02:22.82,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Open the circuit to the wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.42,0:02:25.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Opening the circuit to the wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.38,0:02:27.48,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Close all emergency valves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.48,0:02:29.84,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,CRS booster connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.26,0:02:32.91,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,Neu Deusular is warping out\N at the planned coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.21,0:02:46.84,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Energy charge, 120%.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.49,0:02:48.63,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Ten seconds to fire. {background: Nine, eight, seven, six…}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.43,0:02:50.43,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.43,0:02:51.43,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.43,0:02:52.43,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.43,0:02:53.43,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.63,0:02:51.43,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\pos(976,986)}All hands, prepare for shock and flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.43,0:02:58.58,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&\pos(986,986)}My Neu Deusular will protect the Yamato from the radiant energy from the transit wave motion gun…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.33,0:02:58.33,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.33,0:02:59.33,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,One.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.33,0:03:01.82,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Transit wave motion gun, firing !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.19,0:04:06.98,def2,LAZERA,0,0,0,,H…how…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.98,0:04:09.59,def2,GENITZ,0,0,0,,More powerful than the wave motion gun…?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.81,0:04:14.63,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,A strange fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.63,0:04:16.98,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,The ship guided by Teresa...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.63,0:04:18.78,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,...is the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.38,0:04:28.73,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Incoming message from Zoellgute !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.99,0:04:37.63,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Attention Yamato, the Garmillas forces will use their full \Nstrength to escort you to the center of the imperial capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.63,0:04:41.69,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}{chikyuu}Leave the defense of Earth to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.61,0:04:44.97,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Ambassador Barrel…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.47,0:04:47.63,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}We share the same operational objectives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.63,0:04:51.88,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}The destination is the Emperor's throne room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.88,0:04:55.53,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}{warp}You can't warp into there,\N but with our technology…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.43,0:05:02.23,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,A dimensional submarine has appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:08.92,def2,WOLF,0,0,0,,This is a first attempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.12,0:05:18.63,def2,WOLF,0,0,0,,Even with four special ships, \Nwe can only escort the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.11,0:05:22.26,def2,WOLF,0,0,0,,{sore}And we still have no guarantee of success.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.19,0:05:27.30,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}This must also be fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.56,0:05:31.43,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Let the dimensional submarines guide us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.36,0:05:39.11,def2,WOLF,0,0,0,,Synchronize all ships, then rapid dive {fast }!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:40.18,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Rapid dive !{Diving fast.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.06,0:06:07.33,def2,BERGER,0,0,0,,Hold the line until the Yamato \Ncompletes its objective...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.33,0:06:09.59,def2,BERGER,0,0,0,,...no matter what !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.15,0:07:03.48,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Approaching the break-out point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.48,0:07:06.09,def2,WOLF,0,0,0,,This is as far as we go.{We've done all we can.}{That's all we can do.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.19,0:07:10.08,def2,WOLF,0,0,0,,It's all up to you,{yours,} Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:27.11,def2,WOLF,0,0,0,,See you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.55,0:07:44.73,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Right in the middle of enemy territory ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.73,0:07:46.39,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Keep a sharp eye out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.85,0:07:48.48,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,Unknown heat sources, detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.42,0:07:53.64,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,Karakrum class vessels, but they're small. \NThey vary in size.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.64,0:07:54.53,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,That's…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.93,0:08:00.28,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Just like Katsuragi Touko's information,\N this is where Gatlantis's ships are built.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.03,0:08:04.05,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Link each system to\N the auto-navigation system !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.98,0:08:14.08,def2,GENIZ,0,0,0,,That light…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.17,0:08:29.16,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Diversion through{by} cosmo wave…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.62,0:08:33.13,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,We can't block it because it's \Nour{the} highest clearance level.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.18,0:08:37.31,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,She's also a Silver Maiden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.11,0:08:43.44,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,She's capable of controlling\N the Comet Empire's capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.88,0:08:47.83,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The gate…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.83,0:08:50.88,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The gate's been closed for \Nthe last thousand years, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.81,0:08:53.42,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Sabera…!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.90,0:08:59.30,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,A doll is no match, huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.17,0:09:01.28,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Lazera !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.28,0:09:02.28,def2,LAZERA,0,0,0,,My lord !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.17,0:09:04.50,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Show it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.34,0:09:07.88,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,System hacking, successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.50,0:09:12.13,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,All hands, the ship will enter\N the center of the enemy base !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:14.86,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Space cavalry, move out !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.73,0:09:17.98,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}All space fighters, take off !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.71,0:09:57.48,def2,TOUKO,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}No, it's not accepting my command…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.78,0:10:00.58,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,What's wrong ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.58,0:10:01.78,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Ship's stern hit !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.06,0:10:09.20,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,Starboard aft, it's the engine room !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.20,0:10:10.02,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Captain !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:10.88,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.94,0:10:23.08,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Damage report.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.51,0:10:24.78,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,At this rate, the ship won't…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.40,0:10:29.14,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Zorder knows that Golem is our target.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.63,0:10:33.03,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Do or die…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.18,0:10:36.55,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,We all knew that from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:42.39,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Break through the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.88,0:10:45.78,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Severe damage to the engine ! \NClosing all partitions !{the walls.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.78,0:10:48.91,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Begin emergency maneuvers !\N Turn off all unnecessary power !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.46,0:10:51.89,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,Doctor, the sickbay is full !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.89,0:10:54.34,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Lay him down in the corridor !\NYou know triage, right ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.34,0:10:54.95,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,Yes !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.95,0:10:57.72,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Save as many as possible !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.04,0:11:14.33,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Teresa, can you hear me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.33,0:11:15.21,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Teresa…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.06,0:11:24.32,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I don't remember Telezart.\N But I feel like I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.98,0:11:34.24,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{soko}If you're there, tell me if there's \Nany meaning to this suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.52,0:11:41.01,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{nagasareta}Do our lives have any meaning\N that's worth this bloodshed ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.65,0:11:50.18,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,I can't control the engine output,\N but the ship can maintain speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.73,0:11:51.88,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,{Engine} Chief Engineer Tokugawa...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:52.98,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Chief !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.73,0:11:57.63,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}We're born alone, and die alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.63,0:12:00.12,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Why do people meet ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.54,0:12:01.79,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,Watch out !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.97,0:12:06.33,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Analyzer !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.33,0:12:07.33,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Doctor !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.33,0:12:08.58,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Let me go !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.58,0:12:13.11,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,He's not just a machine !\N There's no replacement !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.52,0:12:24.34,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,Doc...tor…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.42,0:12:29.53,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,...thank you…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.22,0:12:38.13,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}We've lost so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.18,0:12:45.98,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Family, friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.88,0:12:49.64,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}...and even memories with loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.18,0:12:54.24,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I don't want to lose any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.35,0:13:00.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Captain !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.71,0:13:04.76,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Please don't take anymore away !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.09,0:13:10.34,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Please hold on !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.28,0:13:12.34,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Get Doctor Sado !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.34,0:13:13.36,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.72,0:13:17.00,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Remain calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.14,0:13:23.43,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.43,0:13:27.83,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,They're still under Katsuragi Touko's control.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.38,0:13:34.08,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Utilize the Yamato's system\N to make use of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.84,0:13:36.08,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Asteroid ring…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.84,0:13:41.09,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Let it protect our aerial forces, \Nthen break through{into} the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.90,0:13:44.12,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,You can do it, can't you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.79,0:13:46.58,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.10,0:13:50.98,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.43,0:13:57.19,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,...you are the next captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.67,0:14:04.98,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Grab the future with your hands.{Hold the future in your hand.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.92,0:14:29.00,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Future…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.12,0:14:43.22,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Let's carry out former \NCaptain Hijikata's orders !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.93,0:15:09.46,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,The magnetron wave is synchronized\Nwith Touko's cosmo wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.73,0:15:13.63,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,This is Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.63,0:15:17.31,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I'm joining the aerial force, and entering\N the gate with the advance unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.31,0:15:18.11,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Alright !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.11,0:15:19.25,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Enemy ahead !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.80,0:15:26.07,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,What's that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.36,0:15:32.96,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,I'll take care of this, \Nso you guys go ahead !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.96,0:15:33.95,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.77,0:15:36.88,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I won't run.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.88,0:15:39.46,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Now I want to live so badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.03,0:15:43.23,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{makoto}I want to see Makoto's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.23,0:15:46.01,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{makoto}I want to carry Tsubasa on my shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.12,0:15:51.74,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{koremade}I want to do the things I couldn't do before !{have done !}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.95,0:15:56.34,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{orewa}I'll return home alive, no matter what !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.05,0:16:10.48,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}How pathetic of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.83,0:16:17.26,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,But Dad won't give up until the end !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.48,0:16:53.24,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Do you know, Tsubasa ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.23,0:16:57.00,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Your dad is really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.07,0:17:11.97,def2,TOUKO,0,0,0,,I'm closing the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.94,0:17:20.74,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Maximum thrust !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.73,0:17:35.61,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Kodai, I'll take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.97,0:17:46.99,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Keyman…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.49,0:17:56.58,def2,TOUKO,0,0,0,,Opening the Gates of Lerte.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.33,0:18:02.42,def2,TOUKO,0,0,0,,I'll guide you to Golem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.33,0:18:05.29,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,Oh no, they're almost here.{reaching here.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.61,0:18:11.70,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Sabera, you should be able to hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.42,0:18:17.28,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Don't close your mind ! \NWhy do you reject me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.44,0:18:21.98,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,You know better than anyone\N how vain humans are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.98,0:18:25.28,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{horobi}You even reactivated the Ark of Destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.28,0:18:26.63,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{horobi}So why this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.63,0:18:28.88,def2,TOUKO,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have reactivated it !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.56,0:18:33.69,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Why ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.34,0:18:37.13,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Mill…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.13,0:18:40.84,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Our son was killed twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.08,0:18:43.83,def2,TOUKO,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.83,0:18:47.97,def2,TOUKO,0,0,0,,You have a heart, which enables\N you to feel sadness and despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.74,0:18:50.73,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Heart ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.01,0:18:53.23,def2,TOUKO,0,0,0,,You're human...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.63,0:18:56.69,def2,TOUKO,0,0,0,,...more than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.30,0:19:00.48,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.38,0:19:35.00,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Hurry, the gates are…!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:36.10,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Dammit !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.36,0:19:49.88,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.88,0:19:53.23,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,I commend you for making it this far.{ what  you've done so far. }
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.23,0:19:55.79,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,However, I'm curious about your next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.82,0:19:59.78,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{mou}You no longer have the\N protection of that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.79,0:20:02.00,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Touko…?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.65,0:20:03.53,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Why ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.53,0:20:04.64,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,She's your…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.64,0:20:07.28,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,You of all people ask why ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.28,0:20:13.03,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,You sacrificed her and so\N many others to come here !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.03,0:20:17.15,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,You said you wouldn't pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.84,0:20:21.89,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Meet your doom, humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.67,0:20:27.55,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Kodai !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.55,0:20:28.45,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.28,0:20:40.10,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Commander ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.10,0:20:41.42,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Sorry I'm late !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.42,0:20:43.04,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Seize Golem ! Hurry !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.57,0:20:46.00,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, please withdraw for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.26,0:20:59.15,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Are you going to claim victory ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.93,0:21:03.25,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,If you're humans, we should\N be able to talk this out.{there should\Nbe room for us to talk.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.10,0:21:06.45,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Human, you say ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.14,0:21:11.31,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Your future self has taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.61,0:21:15.28,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,That "future"...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.78,0:21:18.03,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,...has died.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.55,0:21:21.28,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}There's no end, as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.14,0:21:22.86,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Watch out !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.66,0:21:48.32,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,You're safe…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.33,0:21:56.96,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,I admit…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.96,0:21:58.96,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Zorder…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.21,0:22:07.02,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,We are also human.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.50,0:22:19.18,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Wait !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.88,0:22:44.88,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(228,870)}Episode 24
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.88,0:22:44.88,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(370,1042)} Yamato, Seize the Comet Empire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.63,0:22:54.51,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Sotto oyasuminasai
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.63,0:22:54.51,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}A gentle goodnight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.51,0:23:01.97,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Osanago no youna toiki
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.51,0:23:01.97,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}You breathe like a little child
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.50,0:23:11.61,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Itsumademo soba ni iru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.50,0:23:11.61,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}I'll be by your side forever
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.61,0:23:17.01,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Mabuta tojite
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.61,0:23:17.01,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}So close your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.01,0:23:30.53,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Hidamari no takeru youna yasashisa de...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.01,0:23:30.53,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}As gentle as warm sunlight...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.53,0:23:37.31,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}...Tsusumi komu yo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.53,0:23:37.31,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}...I'll embrace you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.31,0:23:44.13,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Shiawase umidasu chikara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.31,0:23:44.13,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}The power to bring happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.69,0:23:58.00,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Fuwari fuwari fuwa fuwa yume no naka
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.69,0:23:58.00,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}Drifting and floating, feeling like I'm having a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.00,0:24:10.69,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Omoi haseru yorisoinagara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.00,0:24:10.69,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}Cuddling up and thinking of you from afar
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.11,0:24:25.52,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Itsudemo waratte ite hoshii to negau
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.11,0:24:25.52,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}My wish is for you to keep on smiling
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.52,0:24:38.60,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ubu na egao tayasanu youni
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.51,0:24:38.60,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}Never let your childlike smile disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.65,0:24:50.98,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Itooshii hito yo...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.65,0:24:50.98,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}My dearest{loved} one...
