Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.43,0:23:16.43,Karaoke Translation op,CAST5,0,0,0,,{\a3\pos(1220,388)}Zorder: \NGailane:\NSabera: \NGeniz: \NLazera:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.43,0:23:16.43,Karaoke Translation op,CAST5,0,0,0,,{\a5\pos(1264,190)}Tezuka Hideaki \N  Shibata Hidekatsu\NKaida Yuko \N Umetsu Hideyuki\N Harasawa Kouki
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.98,0:25:20.38,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(970,662)}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.52,0:25:23.14,def2,sanada,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Oh, no. It's spontaneously \Nconsuming the imperial capital…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.16,0:25:25.56,def2,Barrel,0,0,0,,That's the Ark of Destruction…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.57,0:25:27.27,def2,Nanbu,0,0,0,,The Yamato has sustained\N serious damage to the engine...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.27,0:25:29.40,def2,Yuki,0,0,0,,Crash the Yamato into it, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.41,0:25:31.43,def2,Kodai,0,0,0,,I don't want \Nto lose anyone anymore !
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.43,0:25:32.28,def2,Saito,0,0,0,,Kodai !
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.28,0:25:33.46,def2,Keyman,0,0,0,,Grab the future with your hands.{Hold the future in your hand…}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.98,0:25:33.98,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\fscx135\fscy103\pos(964,462)}Episode 25
